[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，艾玛～<br>天亮了哦～？快起床啦。|#0101Adv10_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……嗯……<br>我再睡一会……呃，哇呀呀呀！？|#0101Adv10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

