[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛半睁开眼，便看到了雪莉的大脸。<br>艾玛吓了一大跳，放声大喊。|#0101Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

