[PrintTextModified Text:她慌慌张张四下看了看。<br>这里是牢房里面。|#0101Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这果然不是做梦……<br>　我真的被抓到这个地方了）|#0101Adv10_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:早餐后的放风时间有点长，<br>所以我想去探索一下监牢。你要一起来吗？|#0101Adv10_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯，也好。<br>我去洗个脸，你等我一下。|#0101Adv10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

