@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:哼哼哼～哼♪|#0101Adv10_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:（还是老样子，在画画……）|#0101Adv10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（安安好像不在……<br>　不知道那之后她还有没有事呢）|#0101Adv10_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚在牢房内画的画，又变了一个样子。|#0101Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喷漆画的细节相当丰富，<br>颜色也十分美丽。<br>很难相信一个晚上就能画出来这种品质。|#0101Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:好厉害……|#0101Adv10_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:是气球……|#0101Adv10_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉不禁冒出的这句话，<br>令艾玛有些疑惑。|#0101Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:气球？|#0101Adv10_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:"艾玛你不知道吗？<br>“<ruby=\"Balloon\">气球</ruby>”可是世界有名的街头艺术家哦！|#0101Adv10_Sherry004|" AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:据说他的真实身份是个谜，<br>从未有人见过他的真面目……没想到他就是诺亚耶！|#0101Adv10_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好厉害好厉害好厉害～！<br>诺亚，请你给我签个名！！|#0101Adv10_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:听到有人喊她，诺亚转过头来。|#0101Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:签名？|#0101Adv10_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，你就是【气球】，对吗！？|#0101Adv10_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？哦～对哦～？<br>嘿嘿～好羞人啊～|#0101Adv10_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（真的是……世界有名的艺术家？<br>　我只感觉她就是个有些奇怪的女孩……）|#0101Adv10_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Noah Category:Profile Version:4

[PrintTextModified Text:连这么有名的人也抓来了……|#0101Adv10_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我，我说，她这么有名，<br>被抓来这里肯定会出大新闻吧！？|#0101Adv10_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说来，蕾雅也是艺人欸，肯定会有人讨论失踪的事！<br>现在警察肯定在到处找我们！|#0101Adv10_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的口吻就好像抓住了救命稻草一样。<br>但雪莉没有被这番说法打动，把头扭到了一边。|#0101Adv10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:究竟会怎样呢？<br>我感觉国家有在背后插手这个监牢的事哦。|#0101Adv10_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长也说过了，<br>我们是在全国范围的检查被查验到的。|#0101Adv10_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是真的话，那警察应该<br>不会出手才对。不如说他们才是帮忙抓人的那一边。|#0101Adv10_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定，<br>我们在外面已经被宣布死亡了哦。|#0101Adv10_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉露出清爽的笑容说道，<br>好像说出口的事根本不值一提。|#0101Adv10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会……那也太奇怪了！<br>我们不可以坐以待毙！|#0101Adv10_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们一定要把希罗遇害的消息告诉外面的人！<br>我们去联系救援吧！|#0101Adv10_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。这个方向也算合理。<br>那你就是想准备越狱，对吗？|#0101Adv10_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:越狱……对、对啊。<br>我们是被误抓到这里来的。|#0101Adv10_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，我们先想想怎样越狱吧……|#0101Adv10_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊，不过……昨天想逃跑的亚里沙<br>　好像一下子就被看守抓住了……）|#0101Adv10_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守会不会不止一个呢？|#0101Adv10_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:目前确认到的只有一个吧。<br>只要瞒得过看守的眼睛，<br>我感觉应该有戏。|#0101Adv10_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:我们对这里的了解也太少了。<br>多四处走走，找一下有没有比较好的越狱方法吧！|#0101Adv10_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:收到！|#0101Adv10_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

